                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>On March 30, 1954, President Eisenhower submitted to Congress a special message
                    containing recommendations concerning United States economic foreign policy,
                    based largely on the Randall Commission’s report. For text of the President’s
                    message, see <hi rendition="#italic">Public Papers of the Presidents of the
                        United States: Dwight D. Eisenhower, 1954,</hi> pages 352–364; Department of
                    State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin,</hi> April 19, 1954, pages 602–607; or
                        <hi rendition="#italic">House Document No. 360,</hi> 83d Cong., 2d sess.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
